{
  "_comment": [
    "Deep-content probe questions for the note_search surface (note sectioning",
    "proposal, S3). Each query is answerable ONLY by text that lives beyond",
    "token 512 of the pre-sectioning whole-note embedding base",
    "(title\\nsector\\ncontent[:8000], bge 512-token cap) \u2014 verified by the",
    "deep-region census of 2026-09-06. Queries deliberately AVOID the company/",
    "newsletter name so the FTS title leg cannot carry the note into the page;",
    "retrieval must come from deep body text. 'expect' lists every note that",
    "genuinely contains the fact. Categories: 'semantic' = no rare tokens",
    "(the vector leg must do the work); 'anchored' = rare number/token present",
    "(BM25 control). Mix: 10 company + 5 chatter notes."
  ],
